  "blocks": {
    "\"It's reasoning about the file like it's empty.\"": "“它推理时好像把这个文件当成空文件了。”",
    "\"The tool result came back as a permission denial, not the contents. The model only saw the error string — it has no other way to see the file.\"": "“工具结果返回的是权限拒绝，而不是文件内容。模型只看到了错误字符串——它没有其他途径查看这个文件。”",
    "Because the result is all the model sees, the model has no way to check the environment behind it. If the output was truncated, the command silently failed, or the harness returned an error instead of the contents, the model reasons from what it was given. When the agent's picture of your system seems wrong, the tool results are where to look: somewhere in the transcript is a result that says something different from what you know to be true.": "由于工具结果就是模型能够看到的全部内容，模型无法越过它检查背后的真实环境。如果输出被截断、命令静默失败，或运行框架返回的是错误而非正文，模型仍只能依据收到的内容推理。当智能体对系统的认知明显不对时，应首先检查工具结果：对话记录中的某个结果，很可能与实际情况并不一致。",
    "The lifecycle of a tool result:": "一次工具结果的生命周期如下：",
    "The result stays in the context for the rest of the session. Tool results are usually the bulk of a coding session's context: every file read, every test run, every search lands in full and keeps occupying tokens long after it stopped being useful. A few large results — a verbose test log, a generated file read whole — can push a session toward the edge of the context window faster than the conversation itself does.": "工具结果会在<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/session\">会话</a>剩余时间里一直留在上下文中。编码会话的大部分上下文通常都由工具结果构成：每次文件读取、测试运行和搜索都会完整进入其中，即使早已失去用途，仍会继续占用 <a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/token\">Token</a>。只需几个大型结果——例如冗长的测试日志，或完整读取的生成文件——就可能比对话本身更快地把会话推向<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context-window\">上下文窗口</a>边缘。",
    "Usage:": "<em>用法：</em>",
    "What the harness sends back after executing a tool call — the file contents, the command output, the error. The agent's only view of the environment. Travels back to the model in the next model provider request, where the model decides what to do with it. Tool call and tool result are two ends of the same exchange, both inside one turn.": "工具结果是<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/harness\">运行框架</a>执行<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/tool-call\">工具调用</a>后返回的内容，例如文件内容、命令输出或错误信息。它是<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/agent\">智能体</a>观察<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/environment\">环境</a>的唯一窗口。工具结果会在下一次<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/model-provider-request\">模型提供商请求</a>中送回<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/model\">模型</a>，再由模型决定如何处理。工具调用与工具结果是同一次交换的两端，并且都发生在一个<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/turn\">轮次</a>之内。"
  },
